  "content": "\n\n<h1><strong>此模組是為整合包「<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/nightfallcraft-the-casket-of-reveries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Casket of Reveries</a>」所開發。</strong></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>警告：不建議在「</strong></span><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/nightfallcraft-the-casket-of-reveries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Casket of Reveries</a>」之外使用！</strong></h1>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">請使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-indestructible/files/7125700\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">indestructible 20.13.0+</a>（目前 20.13.0 版本位於 20.12.0 的附加檔案中）</span></strong></h1>\n<p>為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brassamberbattletowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Brass Amber Battle Towers</a> 中的傀儡套用 Epic Fight 修補程式</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_29e9dea8-d17f-4028-b237-d0cbc25b890a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"478\" height=\"454\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_371d7220-b681-4b24-9186-0c845bb1d4c0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"481\" height=\"465\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>現在它們擁有更強大的攻擊動畫與連招。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>新增 8 個自訂 Epic 首領</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1387898/description_3fc33306-4c91-4113-b781-a12885f9408e.png\" width=\"720\" height=\"242\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
